WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Ductwork is where most systems lose efficiency. Learn to read it and you'll find
problems other techs miss.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Full-length Type II practice exam. 25 questions covering high-pressure systems,
recovery levels, leak detection, evacuation, and leak repair requirements.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here's why this matters on the job: Type II has the most questions relevant to
your daily work.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Watch out for these: Recovery levels by charge size. And — Evacuation target and
verification

00:02:24.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Take a minute before you move on. What's the one thing from this lesson you need
to remember on a service call?

